      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563134940,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Round 3: the last node hears it. Each round roughly multiplies the informed nodes, so N nodes need about log N rounds (exact timing depends on cluster size and gossip\ninterval).\nThe news here is: \"container MAC/IP X lives on host Y\", which each node needs to forward overlay traffic. Packets may be lost: another peer repeats the news, which is why\nUDP is fine.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b37",
      "originalText": "Round 3: the last node hears it. Each round roughly multiplies the informed nodes, so N nodes need about log N rounds (exact timing depends on cluster size and gossip interval).\nThe news here is: \"container MAC/IP X lives on host Y\", which each node needs to forward overlay traffic. Packets may be lost: another peer repeats the news, which is why UDP is fine.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
